        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUqo4ugSpVo8TCdZ4Ekju3nghs9LEU1WpFy2zT2VGD4F4ce2Gi_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "VERY disappointed with this company, because yesterday September 8, 2025, I called 7 times!!!!! to speak with the owner about my quote that I have been waiting for about a week. No response I left messages no one calls me back and when I receive my quote they were $5000 more expensive $$$$.",
        "time": 1757451459,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexis Boily",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102031458277216180253/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJGNKOxkLFnb0T_3JcxNo7oE2XVFVW5pRzRGeY0S4Vzw1bDBQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "During the installation of my roof caps, I noticed they had shifted during assembly at STROSS.\n\nI called Serge V. from the Vaudreuil branch, and within an hour and a half, they diagnosed the problem, manufactured, and delivered all my caps to my roof free of charge.\n\n100% in terms of responsiveness, availability, and professionalism.",
        "time": 1751649432,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marianne Raymond",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106791427763905970737/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkPoWmHsmkNenCaFqeGGA81oUiXN6PIUgdSY8A2uK1w69nXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I waited 4 months to be told that Stross would be unable to provide me with a quote for my project (request sent in January!). Poor follow-up, despite my numerous calls and emails seeking follow-up.",
